WHY NONCOMMERCIAL

The word bank is the part of this project that took the real work: clues
written in natural Taglish, calibrated across three difficulty tiers, and
culturally reviewed by Filipinos. The engine is just software and is MIT
licensed precisely because there is no reason to hoard it.

The NonCommercial clause exists so this content cannot be lifted wholesale
into someone else's paid app. Use it in your own free or open project, credit
us, and share alike.

